  "raw_meta_yaml": "schema_version: 1\n\ncontext:\n  version: \"20260301\"\n\npackage:\n  name: texlive-core\n  version: ${{ version }}\n\nsource:\n  url: https://ftp.math.utah.edu/pub/tex/historic/systems/texlive/2026/texlive-${{ version }}-source.tar.xz\n  sha256: cb120d314d3ceb23ac608af17ddd2c623afcf02331f400a0f25eead5b8ac1d70\n\nbuild:\n  number: 1\n  skip: win\n\nrequirements:\n  build:\n    - if: build_platform != target_platform\n      then:\n        - python\n        - cross-python_${{ target_platform }}\n    - ${{ compiler('c') }}\n    - ${{ stdlib(\"c\") }}\n    - ${{ compiler('cxx') }}\n    - pkg-config\n    - texinfo\n    - make\n    - sed\n    - patch\n  host:\n    # glib is required for cairo's pkg-config check\n    - glib\n    - cairo\n    - expat\n    - freetype\n    - fontconfig\n    - gmp\n    - harfbuzz >=1.8\n    - graphite2\n    - icu\n    - libpng\n    - mpfr\n    - pixman\n    - perl 5.*\n    - poppler\n    - zlib\n    - if: linux\n      then:\n        - xorg-libxrender\n        - xorg-libxext\n        - xorg-libxau\n        - xorg-xorgproto\n  run:\n    - fontconfig\n  ignore_run_exports:\n    from_package:\n      - perl 5.*\n\ntests:\n  - script:\n      - pdftex --version\n      - bibtex --version\n      - pdflatex --version\n      - latex --version\n      # The kpathsea binaries embed the build prefix to locate texmf.cnf, so\n      # they must be relocated at install time. If the binaries are excluded\n      # from prefix replacement the build prefix stays baked in, kpsewhich\n      # cannot find texmf.cnf, and tools such as bibtex fail to resolve styles\n      # and databases (this broke doxygen's \\cite handling). Guard against it.\n      - kpsewhich texmf.cnf\n\nabout:\n  license: GPL-2.0-or-later AND GPL-2.0-only AND GPL-3.0-only AND LPPL-1.3c AND LPPL-1.0 AND Artistic-1.0 AND Apache-2.0 AND MIT AND BSD-3-Clause\n  # See https://www.tug.org/texlive/LICENSE.TL\n  license_file: LICENSE.TL\n  summary: An easy way to get up and running with the TeX document production system.\n  homepage: https://www.tug.org/texlive/\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - jakirkham\n    - ocefpaf\n    - xhochy\n    - ngam\n    - erykoff\n",
